  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Requires Attunement by a Spellcaster.</em></p><p>This ring looks like a fleshy purple tentacle banded with dark metal, suffused with a reddish glow. While wearing it, you can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDominateMo]{Dominate Monster} (level 9 version, save DC 19) from it. Once you do, you can't do so again until the next dawn.</p><p>Whenever a creature succeeds on its saving throw against the spell cast from the ring, a chorus of babbling whispers assails your mind: you take 5d10 Psychic damage and have the Incapacitated condition until the end of your next turn.</p>",
